===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Raboot|32}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Kick''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Machop|59}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
